CLASS com/corrodinggames/rts/game/units/d/k com/corrodinggames/rts/game/units/buildings/FactoryBuildQueue
	COMMENT Per-building production queue + producer: owns the BuildQueueItem list, advances progress, checks affordability (CustomPrice), pops finished items and spawns the unit at the rally point/exit offset. Subclasses (e.g. LandFactory$BuildQueue) override du() in their Factory. Logs "Factory no longer has the action:", "buildQueue empty for:". Previously mis-mapped to Factory (collision). [evidence-based job name]
